+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines a 30-day refund window through `refundWindowDays` in `/src/billing.ts`.
+
+Use that window when answering refund disputes. For invoice questions, rely on available project evidence and escalate when invoice status, amounts, or eligibility cannot be established; do not invent billing details.

